    "text": {
     "en": "Celebrations can be small too, like a rainy evening together.\nBela's family sits under a shelter in the garden when it rains.\nThey play antakshari and snakes and ladders and eat hot pakodas.\nDadiji sings songs about the rain and teaches the children.\nThe rain song tells about dark clouds, paper boats in puddles, birds huddled on trees and dancing peacocks.\nThink of a rain song and sing it with your classmates."
    }
